.TH "CORE FUNCTIONS FOR INTERACTING WITH PSTRINGS" "3" "" "pstring 1.5" "pstring manual"
.SH NAME
Core functions for interacting with pstrings \- The pstring_t structure describes strings using 4 variables: \- string's character buffer (pstrbuf), \- the number of characters inside the buffer (pstrlen), \- buffer's size/capacity (pstrcap), \- allocator which owns the buffer's memory (pstrallocator).
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\fB#include <core.h>\fR
.fi
.PP
.nf
